        <mxCell id="n-P2" value="P2: Concrete consequences:&#10;- S3 wrapper takes endpoint_url&#10;  (MinIO 'http://localhost:9000'&#10;  or R2 'https://….r2.cloudflarestorage.com')&#10;- DATABASE_URL is a string —&#10;  no Neon-specific SDK&#10;- REDIS_URL is a string —&#10;  no Upstash-specific SDK&#10;- No Fly/Railway-specific code&#10;  in the container image" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
